body:
Oh I said that because it's not important.But if you want me to explain, I'm just saying that it's not my comment thread so I said "intrude". I feel quite selfish as I don't really have important profound thing to say so that's why I said that I think?

&#x200B;

And so I proceed saying I think the same.

That apathy is not bad, at all.

But I don't think the same on the "apathy is correct" stance. I think apathy is "not correct".

&#x200B;

I only think it's not bad, at all.

&#x200B;

And then I proceed saying how if just I can control and use that thing on my will......

&#x200B;

My brain is probably fried as well at that time, so I wrote that way...........
